<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45725" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφηλις</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπ-</span></b>  (q. v.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφηλίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἧλος</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rivet, burr</i> or <i>dinch</i> to secure a nail, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				63.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).165.13
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in pl., <i>rough spots which stud the
			face</i> (from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἧλος</span>), or, acc. to
			others, <i>freckles</i> (from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤλιος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				2.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Alim.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.215
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.20.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.44
			</span></i> (sg.), etc.: acc. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφήλεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.123
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in sg., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέπρα, ἐ. ἀργινόεσσα,
				λεύκη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				333
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				858
			</span></i>.</div>
